  "description": "The tree: The sole tree in the front garden of 40 Telferscot Rd - a rowan tree\r\rThe intended works: Removal of the tree\r\rReason:  The tree is within 2 meters of the house and of the boundary pavement, with visible tree roots very close to the house.  The edge of the pavement alongside the front garden has already had to be repaired (possibly due to the underlying tree roots though I am not sure of this).  Also, as the tree roots are very close to / break through the surface, it is currently not possible to plant anything else of size in the garden or even fully dig it due to the underlying network of roots.  As well as preventing other planting, it is a problem as their is a persistent ivy problem under the whole front garden that I cannot dig out.",
